# Files that should NOT be deployed to the live site.
# The live storefront is only: index.html, category.html, product.html,
# assets/ (css, js, data, img) and public/products/ (catalog images).

# Offline single-file build — meant to be downloaded and opened locally,
# never served from the web. 42 MB; deploying it only wastes bandwidth.
/FENIX Jewelry (standalone).html
/standalone-src.html

# Build tooling & generated source data — not used by the live pages.
/scripts
/src

# Portable JSON export for reuse in a CMS/app/backend — not used by the live pages.
/data

# Project docs / notes.
/README.md
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Version control internals.
/.git
